{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the timeless embrace of Indian mythology, two souls burn brighter together than apart. Welcome to TWIN FLAMES, a turn-based co-op puzzle adventure where you guide the legendary lovers Savitri and Satyavan on their 27th quest for unbreakable unity. Traverse vibrant, low-poly worlds teeming with ancient wonders\u2014from lush enchanted forests to celestial starlit voids\u2014solving intricate hex-grid puzzles that demand perfect harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.poster.avif?t=1759931676\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.webm?t=1759931676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.mp4?t=1759931676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, embodying both flames in a dance of fate, or invite a partner for local co-op thrills, where every synchronized move deepens your connection and unravels the heartfelt narrative. Outsmart environmental hazards, align cosmic energies, and defy the gods themselves in challenges that blend clever strategy with emotional depth. Will this be the cycle where love triumphs over destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the epic tale of devotion and rebirth, TWIN FLAMES captures the magic of shared journeys. With minimalist art that pops with color and serenity, intuitive controls, and puzzles that evolve from simple sparks to blazing infernos, it's a romantic odyssey for puzzle enthusiasts, mythology lovers, and anyone craving a story that warms the soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.poster.avif?t=1759931676\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.webm?t=1759931676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.mp4?t=1759931676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul-Binding Puzzles:</strong> Tackle turn-based hex-grid conundrums that reward logic, timing, and teamwork\u2014evolve from novice flames to eternal masters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op or Solo Flames:</strong> Seamlessly switch between commanding one character solo or dual-controlling in local co-op for twice the passion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Romance:</strong> Dive into a narrative woven from Savitri's legendary vow, exploring themes of love, loss, and rebirth across 50+ handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Low-Poly Aesthetics:</strong> Journey through breathtaking, colorful realms that blend serene beauty with otherworldly mystery\u2014no two worlds the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Yet Rewarding:</strong> Bite-sized sessions perfect for dates nights or solo reflection, with achievements that celebrate your growing bond.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1